# Daily Review Day55

## 오늘의 핵심 문법

### Modal Verbs

- must + 동사원형
- should + 동사원형
- may + 동사원형
- 조동사 + be + p.p. → 수동태
- 조동사 + have + p.p. → 과거 추측·후회

### Examples

- You must submit the form.
- The report should be completed.
- The package may have been delayed.

